WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.748
Families are coming to Eco Town. They need homes.

2
00:00:04.818 --> 00:00:07.392
<v Posy>Posy: Florence, build strong homes, please!

3
00:00:07.462 --> 00:00:10.327
<v Florence>Florence: Strong? I know strong! Concrete and steel!

4
00:00:10.397 --> 00:00:13.627
<v Florence>Florence: They will stand for years. I am 85% sure!

5
00:00:15.897 --> 00:00:19.422
<v Dev>Dev: They do look strong. But is strong all a home should be?

6
00:00:19.492 --> 00:00:21.719
From the sky, the homes look fine.

7
00:00:21.789 --> 00:00:23.957
How can you check what you cannot see?
